  "chain": "procedure contained incorrect conversion calculations/unclear guidance [cause TBD] -> incorrect voltage inputs given to I&C -> Jet Pump Loop Flow Summers (A & B) miscalibrated -> core flow signal reads ~2% high -> incorrect core flow indication to control room/Core Monitoring System -> TS 3.2.2 MCPR violation [backup: recirc drive flow indication via SO 21-018; MFLCPR limit reduced via SO 21-015]",
