  "notes": "Official cause_code/category were reported as 'TBD'/'provisional' in FORM-366 FIELDS and are copied verbatim; no official code was assigned in the source. Narrative implicates procedure/spreadsheet errors, a knowledge gap in Reactor Engineering, and inadequate prior corrective actions from CR-GGN-2018-8553 (modeled as stub LER per rule 9, using the CR number as stated since no formal LER number was given for that prior event). Recirculation flow system only qualifies as BACKED_UP_BY because SO 21-018 explicitly enabled its use as an alternate operable means of calculating core flow during the event condition."
